$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of compounds 3a,b (general
procedure). Bis(pyridine) silver permanganate AgPy2MnO4 (1.15 g, 3 mmol)
was added portionwise to a solution of compound 1 or 2 (2 mmol) in a
saturated solution of NH3 in MeOH (15 mL) at -10 °C. The reaction mixture
was kept for 0.5-4 h (TLC monitoring), poured into water, and acidified
with HCl to рH 4. Then the mixture was extracted with ethyl acetate (3×50
mL) and dried with Na2SO4. The solvent was evaporated and the residue was
chromatographed on a column (SiO2/CHCl3).
3-(1,3-Dioxolan-2-yl)-4,6-dinitrobenzo[d]isoxazole-7-amine (3b). The
yield was 0.47 g (79%). M.p. 178-181 °C. Found (%): C, 39.97; H, 2.40; N,
18.52. C10H8N4O7. Calculated (%): C, 40.55; H, 2.72; N, 18.92. 1H NMR, δ:
4.00-4.07 (m, 4 H, CH2), 6.76 (s, 1 H, CH), 8.78 (s, 1 H, H(5)), 9.13 (s,
2 H, NH2). IR, ν/cm-1: 3356 (NH2), 1592 (NO2), 1336 (NO2). MS, m/z: 295
[M]+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM chemoselective, regioselective
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
