$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General procedure for the preparation of polyheterocycles (9a-b, 14a-h
and 17a-b) A solution of 6-azido-2-pyridone (0.36 mmol) in
1,2-dichloroethane (3.5 mL) in a sealed vial was heated under microwave
irradiations at 120 °C for 5 minutes. After completion of reaction
solvent was removed under reduced pressure. The crude product was
purified with silica gel chromatography by eluting with
(Dichloromethane:Ethyl acetate 7:3→4:6). Final products were lyophilized
from acetonitrile:water (1:3) mixture. Methyl
(12R)-16-cyclopropyl-10-oxo-14-thia-8.11-diazatetracyclo[7.7.0.02,7.011,15]hexadeca-1(9),2,4,6,15-pentaene-12-carboxylate(9a):
Prepared by following the general procedure, 70 mg of 8a was converted to
48 mg (74%) of 9a isolated as white solid. [α]D-32 (c 0.2, DMSO); IR ν
1750, 1644, 1577, 1464, 1396, 1211 cm-1; 1H-NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6 ) δ
0.63-0.77 (m, 2H), 1.08-1.17 (m, 2H), 2.04-2.11 (m, 1H), 3.58 (dd, J =
2.0, 12.0 Hz, 1H), 3.81(s, 3H), 3.87 (dd, J = 8.8, 12.0 Hz, 1H), 5.85 (d,
J = 2.0, 8.8 Hz, 1H), 7.18 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 1H), 7.39 (dd, J = 0.8, 8.4,
1H), 7.50 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H), 8.31 (t, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H), 11.97 (s, 1H);
13C-NMR (100 MHz, DMSO-d6 ) δ 8.1, 8.4, 11.1, 31.6, 52.8, 61.8, 108.8,
112.4, 119.5, 121.2, 123.5, 125.0, 126.1, 126.2, 134.7, 139.7, 153.5,
169.1. HRMS (EI) calcd (M+Na)+ C18H16N2NaO3S+ 363.0774 observed 363.0792.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM green chemistry, green chemistry-process simplification, microwave
irradiation, sealed tube used
